  "description": "Space Oddity is a bold and innovative street graffiti font that captures the essence of urban art with a futuristic twist. This unique font supports multiple foreign languages, ensuring your designs resonate across the globe. Featuring both uppercase and lowercase letters, Space Oddity offers flexibility and impact for any creative project.\nInspired by the dynamic and rebellious spirit of street tagging, Space Oddity brings your designs to life with its distinctive style. The font is perfect for graffiti artists and enthusiasts, offering a visually striking and entertaining way to write. Space Oddity also includes an array of street graffiti ornaments, adding authenticity and artistic flair to your work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Space Oddity is a bold and innovative street graffiti font that captures the essence of urban art with a futuristic twist. This unique font supports multiple foreign languages, ensuring your designs resonate across the globe. Featuring both uppercase and lowercase letters, Space Oddity offers flexibility and impact for any creative project.</p>\n<p>Inspired by the dynamic and rebellious spirit of street tagging, Space Oddity brings your designs to life with its distinctive style. The font is perfect for graffiti artists and enthusiasts, offering a visually striking and entertaining way to write. Space Oddity also includes an array of street graffiti ornaments, adding authenticity and artistic flair to your work.</p>",
